          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#183449">Source monetary units; product value excludes freight and is not commission revenue or profit. Category orders can overlap. Scroll categorical charts to inspect every group.
Purchase window: Feb 2017–Jul 2018. Final recorded outcomes; no common follow-up horizon. Empty selections show zero counts and undefined averages.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
