          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#183449">Rates describe association, not responsibility. Small groups can have unstable rates. Category counts overlap; the delivery date belongs to the order. On time includes the promised calendar day.
Purchase window: Feb 2017–Jul 2018. Final recorded outcomes; no common follow-up horizon. Empty selections show zero counts and undefined averages.</run>
          </formatted-text>
